{"id":"824c073fd4a6ee10","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-productive-total-injective.md","title":"生产函数可取全定义且单射","display":"lem-productive-total-injective — 生产函数可取全定义且单射","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-productive-total-injective","aliases":["20-lem-productive-total-injective"],"display":"lem-productive-total-injective — 生产函数可取全定义且单射","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.4.4；Exercise 2.4.11","source_printed_pages":[39,40,41],"source_pdf_pages":[75,76,77],"depends_on":["[[20-df-productive]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-productive-total-injective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-productive-total-injective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-productive-total-injective — 生产函数可取全定义且单射"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.4.4；Exercise 2.4.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>39</span><span>40</span><span>41</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>75</span><span>76</span><span>77</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a17bde12e06e430\" href=\"?note=2a17bde12e06e430\" title=\"20-df-productive\">20-df-productive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(P\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProductiveVia}(P,\\psi)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProductiveVia}(P,\\psi)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2a17bde12e06e430\" href=\"?note=2a17bde12e06e430\" title=\"20-df-productive\">20-df-productive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}productive\\text{-}total\\text{-}injective}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{ProductiveVia}(P,p)\\land\\forall i\\ne j\\ p(i)\\ne p(j)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}productive\\text{-}total\\text{-}injective}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{ProductiveVia}(P,p)\\land\\forall i\\ne j\\ p(i)\\ne p(j)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先编译 W_g(e)：等待 ψ(e) 停止后才枚举 W_e。并行运行 ψ(e)、ψ(g(e))，返回先停者 q(e)。若 ψ(e) 不停，W_g(e)=∅⊆P，故 ψ(g(e)) 必停；所以 q 全。W_e⊆P 时两种成功值均属于 P\\W_e，q 仍生产。令 W_h(e)=W_e∪{q(e)}。为选 p(e)，计算序列 q(e),q(h(e)),q(h²(e)),…，直到出现未用值或首次重复；若未用便采用，若重复便任选此前 p 值外的自然数。序列在有限已用集合内继续必重复，因此算法全。若 W_e⊆P，递推各个扩张域仍在 P 内，生产性禁止任何重复，故必选到未用且位于 P\\W_e 的值。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.4.4；Exercise 2.4.11；印刷页 39, 40, 41；PDF 第 75, 76, 77 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-productive","status":"resolved","id":"2a17bde12e06e430","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-productive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}$ 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-productive","status":"resolved","id":"2a17bde12e06e430","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-productive]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-productive]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProductiveVia}(P,\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}productive\\text{-}total\\text{-}injective}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{ProductiveVia}(P,p)\\land\\forall i\\ne j\\ p(i)\\ne p(j)].","display":true}],"bytes":1939,"backlinks":[{"id":"141324e7d302145d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-productive-properties]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。"},{"id":"c99615f5fab6afb5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-productive]]；see [[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]；see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-productive-total-injective]] — 章 2；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]"}],"outgoing":["2a17bde12e06e430","8ba6597a854c206f","e343870c773cb68e"]}